<%= title('Community') %>

<section class='page-container'>
  <div class='grid grid-cols-12'>
    <div class='col-span-12 md:col-start-3 md:col-span-8 space-y-8'>
      <div class='text-center'>
        <h1 class='page-heading-title'>Join the Community</h1>
        <p class='max-w-prose mx-auto prose prose-gray dark:prose-invert text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300'>
          Learning web development is a long journey, but you don't have to do it alone. Working and collaborating with other people is an important part of being a web developer,
          so we encourage you to join our Discord community, where you can grow alongside other Odinites and help each other learn.
        </p>
        <p class='max-w-prose mx-auto mt-4 prose prose-gray dark:prose-invert text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300'>
          Before joining, please read our <%= link_to 'community rules', rules_guides_community_path %> and <%= link_to 'community expectations', expectations_guides_community_path %>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-8 text-center">
    <%= link_to 'Join our Discord server', ODIN_CHAT_URL, class: 'button button--primary text-base px-12 py-4', data: { test_id: 'community-discord-link' } %>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
      Our community chat is hosted on Discord, an external chat platform.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
